    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d593-a1">

                <pb facs="0820" n="750" sameAs="frus:frus1862/pg750"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">National Palace,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi>, </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1862-06-02"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 2, 1862.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> By the annexed copies which I have the
                    honor to transfer to the hands of your excellency you will be made acquainted
                    with the complaints which our principal authority of the State of Tamaulipas has
                    received from the military <pb facs="0821" n="751" xml:id="pg751"/> commander of
                    the sub-district of Rio Grande, on account of the course pursued at Matamoras by
                    the consul of the United States of America in committing hostilities thence on
                    the authorities of the southern States; and, in order to prevent complications
                    that may cause serious damage to Mexico, I doubt not that your excellency will
                    hasten to address positive orders to said consul to the end that he may not
                    compromit the neutrality which Mexico has to observe in the contest
                    unfortunately existing in the United States of America.</p>
                <p>I avail myself of this opportunity to renew to your excellency the assurances of
                    my very distinguished consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>MANUEL DOBLADO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Thomas Corwin,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Envoy Extraordinary and Minister Plenipotentiary of
                            the United States of America.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
